<p dir="auto" data-start="32" data-end="44">The message:</p>
<blockquote data-start="46" data-end="160">
<p dir="auto" data-start="48" data-end="160">“The file is not displayed in the text editor because it is either binary or uses an unsupported text encoding.”</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto" data-start="162" data-end="193">is <strong data-start="165" data-end="190">normal for a real PDF</strong>. ✅</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="195" data-end="271">Your <code data-start="200" data-end="212">resume.pdf</code> is now a proper binary PDF, unlike the previous HTML file.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="273" data-end="298">Now do the final test</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="300" data-end="328">Open your browser and go to:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="330" data-end="374"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-3809bd01.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>http://localhost:5173/resume.pdf</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="376" data-end="429">You should see your formatted <strong data-start="406" data-end="428">VIJAY KUMAR resume</strong>.</p>
