<p dir="auto" data-start="35" data-end="59">The browser is reaching:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="61" data-end="105"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-3809bd01.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>http://localhost:5173/resume.pdf</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="107" data-end="219">but the PDF viewer says <strong data-start="131" data-end="147">0 of 0 pages</strong>. So the file being served by Vite is not the valid PDF content we want.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="221" data-end="249">Let's fix it one final time.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="251" data-end="289"><span role="text">1. Delete the current <code data-start="277" data-end="289">resume.pdf</code></span></h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="291" data-end="302">In VS Code:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="304" data-end="350"><strong data-start="304" data-end="350">Right-click → <code data-start="320" data-end="339">public/resume.pdf</code> → Delete</strong></p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="352" data-end="382">2. Download this fresh PDF</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="384" data-end="448"><button aria-label="Download the verified resume.pdf" class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline px-1 text-token-text-link font-medium" type="button"><span style="display: inline-block; height: 1lh; margin-inline-end: 3px; position: relative; vertical-align: bottom; width: 16px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="library-file-icon" data-library-file-icon-kind="document" data-library-file-icon-key="pdf" class="" style="color: rgb(255, 59, 48); height: 16px; position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 16px;"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.53516 12.3701C5.87432 12.3702 6.18025 12.4338 6.44531 12.5713C6.71717 12.7047 6.92783 12.905 7.07715 13.166C7.2265 13.428 7.29766 13.7366 7.29785 14.082C7.29772 14.4279 7.22688 14.7377 7.07715 15C6.76734 15.5414 6.14153 15.7957 5.53516 15.7959H4.3623V17.6973H3.17871V12.3701H5.53516ZM4.3623 14.7051H5.42676C5.67001 14.705 5.83626 14.6434 5.94434 14.543C6.058 14.4066 6.11506 14.2647 6.11523 14.082C6.11498 13.8696 6.05143 13.7213 5.94434 13.6211C5.83652 13.5214 5.66995 13.4601 5.42676 13.46H4.3623V14.7051Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.6748 12.3701C10.1851 12.3703 10.6402 12.4723 11.0332 12.6807L11.3164 12.8535C11.5845 13.0458 11.8046 13.2935 11.9697 13.5967C12.1899 14.0015 12.2968 14.4832 12.2969 15.0322C12.2968 15.5851 12.1925 16.0698 11.9775 16.4746C11.8166 16.7731 11.6025 17.0213 11.3398 17.2148L11.0596 17.3906C10.6705 17.5954 10.2152 17.697 9.7041 17.6973H7.7832V12.3701H9.6748ZM8.9668 16.6064H9.60449C9.9329 16.6062 10.2067 16.5491 10.4268 16.4434L10.5811 16.3545C10.7258 16.2545 10.8427 16.1197 10.9307 15.9502C11.0476 15.7242 11.1103 15.4203 11.1104 15.0322C11.1102 14.528 11.0033 14.1697 1