<h3 dir="auto" data-start="776" data-end="793">5. Open again</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="795" data-end="839"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-3809bd01.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>http://localhost:5173/resume.pdf</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="841" data-end="860">You should now see:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="862" data-end="877"><strong data-start="862" data-end="877">VIJAY KUMAR</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="879" data-end="904">with the complete resume.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="906" data-end="924">Very important</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="926" data-end="977">When you click <code data-start="941" data-end="953">resume.pdf</code> in VS Code and it says:</p>
<blockquote data-start="979" data-end="1056">
<p dir="auto" data-start="981" data-end="1056">The file is not displayed in the text editor because it is either binary...</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1058" data-end="1077"><strong data-start="1058" data-end="1075">that is GOOD.</strong> ✅</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1079" data-end="1112">Do <strong data-start="1082" data-end="1089">not</strong> click <strong data-start="1096" data-end="1111">Open Anyway</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1114" data-end="1209" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">The only thing we need to test is the browser URL after replacing the file and restarting Vite.</p></div></div></div><div class="w-full max-w-[480px]"><div class="border-token-border-default bg-token-bg-primary mb-2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border"><div id="_r_24h_" class="divide-token-border-light flex flex-col divide-y"><div><div class="group/artifact-row hover:bg-token-bg-secondary/60 relative flex items-center"><button type="button" aria-label="resume.pdf" class="group/open-file peer/open-file interactive-button interactive-label-primary focus-visible:ring-token-border-heavy flex min-w-0 flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 bg-transparent py-3 ps-4 pe-14 text-start focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-inset"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 shrink-0" style="color: rgb(255, 59, 48);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5.53516 12.3701C5.87432 12.3702 6.18025 12.4338 6.44531 12.5713C6.71717 12.7047 6.92783 12.905 7.07715 13.166C7.2265 13.428 7.29766 13.7366 7.29785 14.082C7.29772 14.4279 7.22688 14.7377 7.07715 15C6.76734 15.5414 6.14153 15.7957 5.53516 15.7959H4.3623V17.6973H3.17871V12.3701H5.53516ZM4.3623 14.7051H5.42676C5.67001 14.705 5.83626 14.6434 5.94434 14.543C6.058 14.4066 6.11506 14.2647 6.11523 14.082C6.11498 13.8696 6.05143 13.7213 5.94434 13.6211C5.83652 13.5214 5.66995 13.4601 5.42676 13.46H4.3623V14.7051Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.6748 12.3701C10.1851 12.3703 10.6402 12.4723 11.0332 12.6807L11.3164 12.8535C11.5845 13.0458 11.8046 13.2935 11.9697 13.5967C12.1899 14.0015 12.2968 14.4832 12.2969 15.0322C12.2968 15.5851 12.1925 16.0698 11.9775 16.4746C11.8166 16.7731 11.6025 17.0213 11.3398 17.2148L11.0596 17.3906C10.6705 17.5954 10.2152 17.697 9.7041 17.6973H7.7832V12.3701H9.6748